# Packages every machine gets. Installed by `dotfiles init` via `brew bundle`,
# merged with the local tier's ~/.local/share/new-machine/Brewfile. Work-specific
# tools are installed by work tooling, not here.
# Commented-out entries were deliberately excluded; don't uncomment without asking.
# Add entries with `dotfiles brew decree <name> --global --reason why`. Every entry says why
# it is here: a trailing comment, or a heading comment opening its paragraph.

